@startuml
title Evidence revision and retest\nDesign v0.2-r1 | 2026-10-17
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
autonumber
actor "IT/Security" as IT
actor "Risk Owner" as RO
actor "Reviewer\n(internal or optional consultant)" as Reviewer
participant "VN Digital Trust" as App
database "Assessment history" as Hist
IT -> App: Submit new evidence revision\n(scope, source, time)
App -> App: Check current RBAC and scope
alt submission denied / expired
  App -> Hist: Record denied action in audit
  App --> IT: Denied; no evidence change
else submission authorized
  App -> Hist: Append EvidenceRevision UNVERIFIED\nPreserve prior revision
  alt internal self-assessment
    IT -> App: Submit verify/reject decision\nwith source checks and reason
  else assigned reviewer available (optional)
    Reviewer -> App: Submit verify/reject decision\nwith source checks and reason
  end
  App -> App: Check evidence.verify + read scope\nand current access expiry for verifier
  note right of App
    Evidence reads are separately authorized
    before content is shown to either actor.
    Recheck permission when saving a decision.
  end note
  alt verifier unauthorized / expired
    App -> Hist: Audit denial; evidence stays UNVERIFIED
  else verifier authorized
    App -> Hist: Append verification decision\n(actor, time, scope, reason, provenance)
  end
  IT -> App: Request retest
  App -> App: Check current assessment.run permission\nand context / criteria / profile versions
  alt retest unauthorized / expired
    App -> Hist: Audit denial; no assessment change
    App --> IT: Denied
  else retest authorized
    App -> Hist: Append new context + evidence references
    App -> App: TUC-06: assess evidence and test execution
    alt any criteria failure verified
      App -> Hist: Append NOT_SATISFIED / PARTIALLY_SATISFIED\nCONTROL_GAP; retain other EVIDENCE_GAPs
    else no verified failure
      alt all criteria verified satisfied
        App -> Hist: Append SATISFIED with criteria and evidence
      else unusable evidence / INCONCLUSIVE / incomplete criteria
        App -> Hist: Append INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE\nKeep EVIDENCE_GAP open
      end
    end
    App -> App: TUC-04: confirm G coverage AND strength per path\nUnknown/disputed paths stay UNKNOWN
    RO -> App: Confirm impact inputs with source and authority
    App -> App: Validate context/domain; calculate R25/bounds\nInvalid input: score/range null, NEEDS_REVIEW
    App -> Hist: Append RiskEvaluation snapshot\nscore_determined separate from status
    opt optional review / disagreement
      Reviewer -> App: Submit finding and reason
      App -> App: Recheck assessment.review, scope and expiry
      alt review authorized
        App -> Hist: Append review finding; preserve prior snapshot\nUnresolved dispute: new snapshot NEEDS_REVIEW
      else review denied
        App -> Hist: Audit denial; no result change
      end
    end
    App -> App: Compare equivalent snapshots only\nElse NOT_COMPARABLE
    App --> RO: R / impact_progress / gap_progress\nverified_worsening + before/after impact summaries
    opt operational priority / treatment / acceptance
      RO -> App: Decide with scope and reason
      App -> App: Recheck decision-specific authority
      App -> Hist: Append authorized decision (else audit denial)\nPreserve raw control results and gaps
    end
    opt gap/task closure requested
      IT -> App: Request closure against task criteria
      App -> App: Check closure authority + verified criteria\nEvidence VERIFIED alone is insufficient
      App -> Hist: Append authorized closure or keep open\nNo closure from score reduction alone
    end
    App --> IT: Report old/new snapshots and unresolved issues\nRead permission checked for each evidence link
  end
end
@enduml
